      "created_at": "2014-05-31T17:08:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Station cards, on their blue sides, have one of two red icons on them, either a targeting symbol or a kind of a three-pointed ninja star symbol. I haven't been able to figure out what information these icons are trying to give me. It's not that one is for Techs and the other for Boosts (which would have made sense, if true). Does anyone else know what these icons are for?</p>",
