      "created_at": "2014-05-31T23:28:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>\n[quote=\"Foote\"]\n</p><p>&nbsp;I think I saw only one card where the symbol is switched due to typo</p><p>\n[/quote]\n</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Yup, \"Xushin Cannon\" has the red ship symbol, but the Opp side is \"Fleet Wide Upgrade,\" a boost.<br><br>I've been coming up with a list of typos and possible misprints, and that was one of the first ones I caught.</p>",
